CATEGORIES:community,free
DESCRIPTION:https://sf.funcheap.com/family-math-quest-free-outdoor-escape-
 room-adventure-salesforce-park/\nLocation: san francisco\nPrice: Free\nCat
 egories: community\, free\nSource: funcheap/san-francisco\n\nA day of puzz
 les\, discovery\, and creative problem-solving! Join us at Salesforce Park
  for Journey Across America\, an outdoor\, escape-room-style Family Math Q
 uest! Kids and parents work together to solve creative math and logic puzz
 les\, crack codes\, uncover clues\, and make their way across America\, di
 scovering famous cities\, iconic landmarks\, national parks\, and natural 
 wonders along the way. Cross the country without ever leaving San Francisc
 o! Designed for kids in grades K-6 and their families. Work at your own pa
 ce and arrive anytime during the event\; allow about 1.5 hours to complete
  the quest. Sunday\, September 13 11:00 AM–2:00 PM PT Salesforce Park\, 
 San Francisco (4th floor park) Free What is a Family Math Quest? A Family 
 Math Quest is part outdoor escape room\, part treasure hunt\, and part mat
 h adventure. Families move between stations\, solving creative math and lo
 gic puzzles\, cracking codes\, and uncovering clues together. There’s no
  set start time or pace\, arrive anytime during the event window and work 
 your way through the quest at your own speed. Plan for about 1.5 hours of 
 problem-solving\, teamwork\, and fun outside!
LOCATION:san francisco
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/family-math-quest-free-outdoor-escape-room-adv
 enture-salesforce-park/
