 it Series invites families\, caregivers\, young people\, and community mem
 bers from across San Francisco to help shape the future of our city. Satur
 day\, Sept. 19\, 2026\, 11:00 a.m. – 2:30 p.m. Gene Friend SOMA Recreati
 on Center \, 270 6th St\, SF\, CA 94103 Free food\, childcare\, and interp
 retation are provided. Please note all interpretation requests must be mad
 e 48 hours or more prior to the Family Summit. Who should attend? Everyone
  is welcome. This event highlights District 6\, but you can attend any Fam
 ily Summit that fits your schedule. Why are we gathering? The Family Summi
 t Series is part of San Francisco’s first Citywide Community Needs Asses
 sment. Through conversations with families across the city\, we’re learn
 ing what matters most to children\, youth\, young adults\, and families. W
 hat we learn will help improve future planning\, programs\, and services. 
